WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.060
Good morning Hank, it's Sunday,

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:03.000
June 28th 2009.

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:03.900
And I'm angry.

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:05.200
*John screams and whips his hair back and forth*

00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:12.900
So Hank, as you know, in our two and a half year conversation,

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:17.280
we've now uploaded more than five hundred videos. Congratulations by the way,

00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:22.040
and thanks to the awesomeness of Nerdfighters, our videos have been watched lots and lots of times.

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:24.300
But not everyone who's watching them is awesome.

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:28.560
So Hank, I'm gonna read you some comments that people have posted in the last week on Vlogbrothers videos.

00:00:28.560 --> 00:00:32.200
These are all direct quotes, except for every time they use a curse word, I'm going to use the name -

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:33.800
- of a famous american poet.

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:36.740
'You Walt Whitman-ing Ednis-ing Vincent Mulet.'

00:00:36.840 --> 00:00:38.760
'Go Emily Dickinson your mom!'

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:41.860
Thanks for the advice, you pathetic piece of E.E.Cummings.

00:00:41.860 --> 00:00:43.240
But I think I'm gonna pass.

00:00:43.680 --> 00:00:47.200
'You Robert Frosting Nikki Giovanni! Get a life nerd!'

00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:48.320
'You're a virgin!'

00:00:48.320 --> 00:00:51.280
*Screams of anguish and head rubbing intensifies*

00:00:51.280 --> 00:00:55.360
'Hey bro, you need to go outside and get some fresh air into you, or a girlfriend."'

00:00:55.360 --> 00:00:57.600
I need to get a girlfriend into me?

00:00:57.600 --> 00:01:01.300
I think that shows a fundamental lack of comprehension about how babies are made.

00:01:01.900 --> 00:01:05.260
'You are a complete Ann Sexton stupid!'

00:01:05.260 --> 00:01:09.000
Okay, couple things, first off; if you're accusing someone of being stupid, you should probably -

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:13.900
know that in that context, 'you're' is a contraction, and any time you're contraction 'you are' -

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:17.980
it's spelled Y-O-U-APOSTROPHE-R-E!

00:01:17.980 --> 00:01:23.640
OHMYGOD YOUTUBE! Before you click submit comment; read your comment and ask yourself -

00:01:23.700 --> 00:01:29.200
do I mean ''You are"! And if you do, [whispers] you need and apostrophe.

00:01:29.360 --> 00:01:34.920
Secondly, accusing someone else of being stupid, implies that you have the intellectual facility to

00:01:34.920 --> 00:01:41.800
know the difference between stupid and smart! A case that is not bolstered when you use stupid as a noun!

00:01:42.020 --> 00:01:44.740
'This video is so Ralph Waldo Emerson Gay.'

00:01:44.900 --> 00:01:45.860
'You're gay'

00:01:45.900 --> 00:01:47.400
'You're a gay nerd'

00:01:47.520 --> 00:01:48.020
'Gay'

00:01:48.020 --> 00:01:52.480
Okay YouTube, apparently we have to have a talk about this. Because you're obsessed with calling

00:01:52.480 --> 00:01:53.140
things gay.

00:01:53.140 --> 00:01:57.360
So I thought this was pretty wildly known but I guess I have to explain what gay means.

00:01:57.360 --> 00:02:00.600
Being gay means that you are attracted to people of the same gender.

00:02:00.600 --> 00:02:03.600
So a video can't be gay, because it doesn't have a gender.

00:02:03.600 --> 00:02:08.640
Hank, I never thought I would have to do this but, I think I have to explain to YouTube how insults work.

00:02:08.800 --> 00:02:13.500
When you're insulting someone, what you wanna do is you wanna make them feel bad about themselves.

00:02:13.500 --> 00:02:17.860
So you wanna paint them with character traits or identities that are bad.

00:02:17.860 --> 00:02:22.900
So for instance, Hank, if I wanted to hurt your feelings, I might say that you're a selfish coal-fired power plant.

00:02:22.900 --> 00:02:27.500
But to read YouTube comments, you would think that the worst thing in the world to be is not a -

00:02:27.600 --> 00:02:31.360
- selfish coal-fired power plant, but a gay virgin nerd.

00:02:31.360 --> 00:02:35.400
We have this weird thing in the world where  you don't get insulted for what you do, you get

00:02:35.400 --> 00:02:36.600
insulted for who you are.

00:02:36.600 --> 00:02:41.380
And ultimately, 'gay' will never work as an insult, because it's not bad.

00:02:41.500 --> 00:02:43.620
So you wanna call me a gay nerd virgin?

00:02:43.720 --> 00:02:44.600
That's fine.

00:02:45.100 --> 00:02:50.800
Believe me when I say, you are not embarrassing me. You are embarrassing yourself.

00:02:50.800 --> 00:02:57.000
You wanna insult me? Take a lesson from this guy: 'You look kinda like that guy from Wild Hogs, lol'

00:02:57.000 --> 00:02:57.980
Wha- What guy from Wild-?

00:02:59.260 --> 00:02:59.980
Tim Allen?

00:03:00.800 --> 00:03:02.240
I look like Tim Allen?

00:03:02.600 --> 00:03:04.500
Wow Hank, that's a burn.

00:03:04.500 --> 00:03:08.900
Nerdfighters, on Tuesday I'm gonna do a question Tuesday, so please leave great questions in comments.

